{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20044","headline":"赠主人 · 孟郊","name":"赠主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斗水泻大海，不如泻枯池。\n分明贤达交，岂顾豪华儿。\n海有不足流，豪有不足资。\n枯鳞易爲水，贫士易爲施。\n幸覩君子席，会将幽贱期。\n侧闻清风议，饫如黄金巵。\n此道与日月，同光无尽时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}